# The kernel's thermal enum on its own scale: HEAVY (2, Apple's "serious":
# performance impacted) must be red. Moving the red line to 3 (trapping) leaves a
# throttled machine yellow — and yellow does not carry the "load figures understate
# the work" finding that is the dimension's whole point.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/config.rs
test: a_heavy_thermal_level_is_red_with_the_kernels_words_and_no_action
---OLD---
            thermal: BandSpec::rising(1.0, 2.0, 0.5, 2),
---NEW---
            thermal: BandSpec::rising(1.0, 3.0, 0.5, 2),
